","Courtier Merchant Temp","Leader Us","Player Us"],"text":"[character] has found a number of potential recruits for the court. He presents the most promising two before you. Are either of the candidates worthy of joining the court?","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":1},{"author":"Leyla Johnson","conditions":["Player Max Three Courtiers"],"followsFrom":[{"cat":"courtier","id":"EVENTSTORY_COURTIER_A1","name":"Great Achievers"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_COURTIER_A2","isFollowup":true,"linkPrereq":"EVENTLINK_COURTIER_A1","name":"Brilliant Achievers","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-320,"per":-80,"text":"-320 Money (-80/city)","yield":"money"},{"text":"Gain a Court Soldier"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeBonuses: BONUS_MONEY_LOSS_HUGE, BONUS_ADD_GREAT_SOLDIER"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_COURTIER_A2_SOLDIER","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"The vigorous commander."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-320,"per":-80,"text":"-320 Money (-80/city)","yield":"money"},{"text":"Gain a Court Merchant"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeBonuses: BONUS_MONEY_LOSS_HUGE, BONUS_ADD_GREAT_MERCHANT"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_COURTIER_A2_MERCHANT","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"The wealthy vendor."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+20 XP to the character"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iXPCharacter 20"],"id":"BONUS_XP_CHARACTER_SMALL","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"We cannot afford to pay that much."}],"subjects":["Player Us"],"text":"More lowborn achievers have captured the attention of the court. We should raise one of them up to serve us in a more influential role. Whom shall we choose?","timing":{"repeat":"Every 0 turns"},"weight":2},{"author":"Leyla Johnson","conditions":["Player Max Three Courtiers"],"followsFrom":[{"cat":"courtier","id":"EVENTSTORY_COURTIER_B1","name":"Great Thinkers"}],"id":"EVENTSTORY_COURTIER_B2","isFollowup":true,"linkPrereq":"EVENTLINK_COU