ney (-40/city)","yield":"money"},{"text":"Gain a Court Soldier"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_MONEY=-160","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_MONEY=-40"],"id":"BONUS_MONEY_LOSS_AVERAGE","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["AddCourtier: COURTIER_SOLDIER"],"id":"BONUS_ADD_GREAT_SOLDIER","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Thank you. I owe you my life. Please accept this small token of gratitude."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+3 Legitimacy"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iLegitimacy 3"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_IN_BROAD_DAYLIGHT","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"I imagine you wish to return the fallen to their families. I shall not forget them."}],"prob":75,"subjects":["Us Or Them","Leader Us","Player Us"],"text":"As you march through the streets at the head of a ceremonial procession, a hail of arrows suddenly falls around you. Your guards grab you and rush you towards a narrow alley off the main road. A glance behind you reveals a mess of bodies, both citizens and guards slain alike. Your chief guard sets you down in the alley, cursing after a look at your leg. Looking down yourself, you are faintly surprised to realize an arrow has embedded itself in your ceremonial robes and punctured your leg, the dark blood staining the sandy earth. The pain and weakness washes over you and you collapse to the floor. Later you learn that only the quick actions of your chief guard have saved your life this day, chasing off the assassins while giving you medical attention. The chief guard stands before you, tears in eyes. \"My [title]. I lost a lot of good men out there. Don't let them down.”","timing":{"minTurns":40,"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":1},{"author":"Velociryx","conditions":["Player Max Two Courtiers"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_INDEPENDENT_MERCHANT","name":"Independent Merchant","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-240,"per":-60,"text":"-240 Money (-60/city)","yield":"money"},{"t