":[{"text":"Opinion memory"},{"text":"Gain a Court Minister"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["Memory MEMORYPLAYER_STOLE_COURTIER"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_STEALING_TALENT_OPTION_0_PLAYER","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["MakeCourtier COURTIER_MINISTER"],"id":"BONUS_MAKE_GREAT_MINISTER","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Bring [character] to your court."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Leader relationship: Influenced By"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["AddLeaderRelationship RELATIONSHIP_INFLUENCED_BY"],"id":"BONUS_LEADER_INFLUENCED_BY","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Seek [character] forgiveness for the misunderstanding."}],"pack":"The Sacred and the Profane","subjects":["Us","Player Them","Courtier Minister Temp","Player Us"],"text":"[character] has come to you with an unexpected proposal. The Chancellor has made contact with a talented administrator from the court of [character], who would be willing to move to your court instead after being mistreated and overlooked in the [rival] court. Adopting this minister will undoubtedly anger [character]. Will the plan go ahead?","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":2},{"author":"Josh Unsworth","conditions":["Inquisitive","Player Max Two Courtiers"],"dlc":"Religion event pack","id":"EVENTSTORY_THE_HALF_OBOL","name":"The Half Obol","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain a Court Merchant"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["MakeCourtier COURTIER_MERCHANT"],"id":"BONUS_MAKE_GREAT_MERCHANT","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Welcome [character] to the court."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+60 XP to the character"},{"text":"+40 XP to the character"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iXPCharacter 60"],"id":"BONUS_XP_CHARACTER_LARGE","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["iXPCharacter 40"],"id":"BONUS_XP_CHARACTER_AVERAGE","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"We will look elsewhere for a new courtier."}],"pack":"The Sacred and the Profane","prob":25,"subjects":["Important Us","City Us","Courtier Merchant Temp","Leader Us","Player Us"],"text":"[character] heard a strange rumor while in [city], that there was a merchant with unending amounts of money. The tale goes that he has a magical coin that will return to the spender's pocket at the end of each day. [character] laughs when confronted with the story, putting such tales down to his talent in trading. Magic coin or not, should [character] join the court?","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":1},{"author":"Josh Unsworth","conditions":["Chancellor"],"dlc":"Religion event pack","id":"EVENTSTORY_SHUNNED_CLERGY","name":"The Shunned","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Leader relationship: Disappointed With"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["AddLeaderRelationship RELATIONSHIP_DISAPPOINTED_WITH"],"id":"BONUS_LEADER_DISAPPOINTED_WITH","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["iJoinSubject 3","aeBonuses: BONUS_MAKE_CLERGY"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_SHUNNED_CLERGY_OPTION_0_CHARACTER_2","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Restore [character] and bring him to your court."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Leader relationship: Influenced By"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["AddLeaderRelationship RELATIONSHIP_INFLUENCED_BY"],"id":"BONUS_LEADER_INFLUENCED_BY","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Refuse to sour relations with [character]."}],"pack":"The Sacred and the Profane","subjects":["Us","Religion Player","Us Or Them","Player Us","Courtier Minister Temp"],"text":"[character] has met an erudite and talented member of the [religion] clergy, who would make an excellent minister in your court. However, the has recently been stripped of his titles by [character] after a particularly heated ecumenical disagreement. The potential minister asks that you use your influence to get him restored to the clergy.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"weight":8},{"author":"Andy Auseon","conditions":["Not Player Character","Player Egypt"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_CHARACTER_THE_STEWARD","name":"The Steward","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain a Court Minister"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["MakeCourtier COURTIER_MINISTER"],"id":"BONUS_MAKE_GREAT_MINISTER","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"The court could use another discerning mind."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iGovernorOfSubject 0"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_CHARACTER_THE_STEWARD_OPTION_1_CHARACTER_0","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"He will make an effective Governor."}],"subjects":["City Us","Tutor Egypt Senenmut","Spouse Of Leader Us","Player Us"],"text":"It has come to our attention that your husband's personal steward has a keen eye for detail. Despite his common birth, Senenmut's administration of the royal household has been nothing short of astounding. We must take advantage of such talent.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Senenmut","weight":2},{"author":"Josh Unsworth","conditions":["Chancellor","Player Max Three Courtiers"],"dlc":"Religion event pack","id":"EVENTSTORY_HOLY_WARRIOR","name":"Warrior of","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain trait: Loyal","tip":["+1 Discipline","+20 opinion with same-trait characters"],"tipTitle":"Loyal — trait"},{"text":"Gain a Court Soldier"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["MakeCourtier COURTIER_SOLDIER","aeAddTraits: TRAIT_LOYAL"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_HOLY_WARRIOR_OPTION_0_CHARACTER_2","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[{"tag":"LeaderSubject","values":["SUBJECT_CHARACTER_OF_STATE_RELIGION"]}]},"requirements":[],"text":"Accept [character] as your own bodyguard."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Leader relationship: Holds Favor From"},{"text":"Gain a Court Soldier"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["AddLeaderRelationship RELATIONSHIP_HOLDS_FAVOR_FROM"],"id":"B